      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "A beginner-friendly baby elephant at approximately 12 cm finished height. The big sphere head, small oval body, and short capsule trunk make this an approachable first amigurumi project. Large flat oval ears sewn to the sides of the head complete the baby elephant look."
          }
        ]
